---
// Large display quote. Editorial pull-quote.
---

<blockquote
  style="margin: var(--gap-xl) 0; padding: 0; background: transparent; border: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink); text-align: center; font-style: italic;"
>
  <span style="display: block; font-style: normal; color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">&ldquo;</span>
  <slot />
</blockquote>
